---
/**
 * The entry veil.
 *
 * Browsers block audio autoplay and the IFrame API needs a genuine user gesture,
 * so an interaction is unavoidable. Rather than apologising for it, it is the
 * title screen — the threshold into the ghat.
 */
---

<button class="gate" id="gate" type="button">
  <span>
    <span class="gate__title">छठ पूजा</span>
    <p class="gate__hint">शुरू करने के लिए स्पर्श करें · tap to begin</p>
  </span>
</button>
